  "structuring": {
    "prompt_additions": "Use ARTICLE (not SECTION) as the basic unit keyword. Hierarchy is PART > CHAPTER > ARTICLE. Subdivisions use decimal dot notation (5.1, 5.1.1) — output as PARAGRAPH and SUBPARAGRAPH with decimal num values. Not all laws use PART; detect the highest division present. The attestation block (adopted by/signed by) appears at the END of the document — model as CONCLUSIONS, not PREAMBLE."
  },
